  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://camo.githubusercontent.com/de598b3df8f1384155983bb22d9eea857236fdc12c9ec48dc1276d47b1e67484/687474703a2f2f692e696d6775722e636f6d2f4c6448353268472e706e67\" alt=\"\" width=\"1215\" height=\"604\"></p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>Flux Networks 由 SonarSonic 制作</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:10pt;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>描述：</strong> Flux Networks 让你能够构建无线能量网络。你可以自定义这些网络，管理能量在世界中的流动。不再需要到处铺设线缆，从而减少卡顿并节省时间。能量还可以跨维度传输，使能量管理变得简单。</span></p><p>&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">主要特性</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">无线跨维度传输</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">自动能量转换</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">无限传输速率</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">支持 Forge Energy、EU、AE2 和 IE</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">跨维度物品栏充电</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">密码保护加密网络</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">管理网络优先级</span></li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>附加特性</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">为网络命名和着色</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">为每个连接命名以便识别</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">配置允许访问网络的玩家</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">图表监控近期能量峰值/下降</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">无线编辑所有连接的设置</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">每个连接提供区块加载能力</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">超级管理员：删除不活跃网络、转移所有权等</span></li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>截图：</strong></span></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2019/09/23/1ZVtXlg3MvBIGQH.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"351\" height=\"398\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2019/09/23/reLOqVAwiDTaQvx.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"352\" height=\"392\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2019/09/23/6FdKngioTEyaB5N.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"359\" height=\"409\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2019/09/23/QlBPcfvV15pjzs4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"353\" height=\"397\"><img src=\"https://i.loli.net/2020/11/06/4viGd9P3nUBZxLV.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"765\" height=\"469\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><hr><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>版本 4.0.7 及以上</strong></span><br></span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">Flux Networks 已由 BloCamLimb 重写。这个新版本对服务器更友好，不再需要 SonarCore。原版的大部分功能得以保留，但有些功能尚未重新实现或略有改动。此外，还添加了许多新功能！<br>了解更多请<a href=\"https://github.com/SonarSonic/Flux-Networks/tree/1.12.2-refactored\" rel=\"nofollow\">点击这里</a></span></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>版本 3.0.19 及以下：</strong> 所有这些版本<strong>需要<a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/sonar-core\" rel=\"nofollow\"> Sonar Core</a></strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>适用于 1.7.10 的版本：</strong> 请参见<a href=\"http://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/calculator\" rel=\"nofollow\">Calculator</a></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>整合包：</strong> 欢迎在任何整合包中使用本模组。</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>问题反馈：</strong> 请在 <a href=\"https://github.com/SonarSonic/Flux-Networks/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 页面</a>提交所有问题。</span></p><hr><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14pt;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">有问题或建议？快来加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/JVkVCV7\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 服务器</a>吧！</span></p>",
